[manpage_begin tuagrep n 0.1]
[moddesc {tclutils}]
[titledesc {Approximate grep}]
[require Tcl 8.6]
[require tclutils::tuagrep 0.1]
[description]
[para]The [package tclutils::tuagrep] package searches lines approximately using [package tclutils::tufuzzy].
[section COMMANDS]
[list_begin definitions]
[call [cmd ::tclutils::tuagrep::search] [arg text] [arg pattern] [opt options]]
Searches text for approximate matches.
[call [cmd ::tclutils::tuagrep::file] [arg filename] [arg pattern] [opt options]]
Searches a file.
[list_end]
[manpage_end]
